\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Ten thousand times ten thousand,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In sparkling raiment bright,
\par The armies of the ransomed saints
\par Throng up the steeps of light;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 'Tis finished, all is finished,
\par Their fight with death and sin;
\par Fling open wide the golden gates,
\par And let the victors in.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  What rush of hallelujahs
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Fills all the earth and sky!
\par What ringing of a thousand harps
\par Bespeaks the triumph nigh!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O day for which creation
\par And all its tribes were made!
\par O joy, for all its former woes
\par A thousand-fold repaid.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  O then what raptured greetings
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  On Canaan's happy shore,
\par  What knitting severed friendships up
\par  Where partings are no more!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Then eyes with joy shall sparkle
\par  That brimmed with tears of late
\par  Orphans no longer fatherless,
\par  Nor widows desolate.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Bring near Thy great salvation,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj   Thou Lamb for sinners slain;
\par Fill up the roll of Thine elect,
\par  Then take Thy power and reign;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Appear, Desire of nations -
\par  Thine exiles long for home;
\par  Show in the heaven Thy promised sign;
\par \pard       Thou Prince and Saviour come.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

